@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="card card-custom p-4">
            <h1 class="h3 fw-bold text-navy">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-muted">How the Community Service Portal handles your information.</p>

            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold mt-3">What we collect</h2>
            <p>When you report a problem we store the issue type, your description, the location you give us, an optional photo, and the date and time of the report. We do not ask for your name or contact details.</p>

            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold mt-3">How we use it</h2>
            <p>Reports are used only by authorised municipal staff to prioritise, assign and resolve service requests, and to show you the progress of your own report through its reference number.</p>

            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold mt-3">Your reference number</h2>
            <p>Anyone holding a reference number can see the status of that report. Please do not share it publicly if the report contains sensitive details. Photos are visible to municipal staff only.</p>

            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold mt-3">Storage and security</h2>
            <p>Data is stored in a managed PostgreSQL database and transmitted over HTTPS. Access to the staff dashboard requires a municipality login.</p>

            <p class="text-muted small mb-0 mt-3">This portal is a student project built for CLDV6212 and is not an official government service.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
